// Additional question pool — merged into D.quizzes at runtime.
// Calibrated for the NHBRC homebuilder competency test:
//   - Site classifications, foundation widths, mortar classes
//   - DPC, brick courses, mesh, ties
//   - Roof timber grading, truss tie-down, wind zones
//   - Plumbing falls, vent stack, soil stack diameters
//   - Inspection schedule, enrolment / warranty mechanics
//
// All entries factually defensible against the bundled NBR 2008,
// Act 95/1998, SABS 0400-1990, and standard SA homebuilding practice.

